{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/11395","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"11395","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"TX715 .V4 1923","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Rare recipes, old and new  ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"J.C. Winston","id":"actor/j-c-winston","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1923","begin_of_the_begin":"1923-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1923-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"abq copy : fair condition.|SColl abq : Embossed stamp on edition page : Georgia O'Keeffe / Abiquiu, New Mexico.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Ephemera found between pp. 120-121 : Handwritten note by unknown : [Fa Yung Ha?].\nEphemera found between pp. 56-57 : Handwritten postcard from unknown ('Me') to Miss M. Sibyl Browne c/o Alfred Stieglitz, August 31, 1923 : note was sent from San Antonio to Lake George and mentions cooking Mexican food, chile con carne, and cooking for O'Keeffe.\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nLimited ed. ; no. 1023.\nPage marker found between pp. 14-15 ; 146-147 ; 190-[191].\nBlank pages for notes are interspersed.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}